quadrf-phasegaze (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * wifi,web,csi: Add 802.11 decode path and packet inspector
  * debian: Hand synths back to automatic VAS on stop
  * web: Use 500 ms hold dwell on desktop and touch
