  * web: Clarify HTTP camera notice wording
  * web: Improve HUD contrast on camera and show RF gain value
  * web: Park hold LO on the picked center and add 1 MHz tune
  * web: Clarify dwell hints and align touch hold to OS haptic
  * web: Fix video window frame decode deadlock and mode-switch flicker
  * video,web: Publish autosteer aim on NTSC frames and overlay reticle
  * video,web,csi: Add NTSC watch path and cluster hold-to-dwell
  * tests: Add pg_rfdiag LO health capture and widen perf full span
  * web: Board sweep limits, lock cal UI, and 6 GHz freq panel
  * csi,phasegaze: Measure MAX2851 lock pin range and clamp hop sweep
  * ui: Default camera mode, persist freq tab, rings off
  * web,dsp: Tag spectrum with plan LO and settle FFT on range change
  * dsp,web,csi: Fold warm vn into spectrum and per-LO FFT hop EQ
  * tests: Add quadrf-2 rxresp captures analysis and comb sideband scoring
  * web: Drop fixed-spur mask toggle and spur margin slider
  * tests: Add rxcap receiver-response capture, per-stage bench and rxresp results
  * web: Add CFAR threshold, RX background norm and spur margin controls with gate rate readout
  * dsp: Add receiver background normalization before CFAR; expose CFAR threshold and spur margin
  * dsp: Notch 40 MHz spur comb and its IQ image before CFAR
  * web: Queue point upload ranges per packet instead of replacing them
  * tests: Add perf probe, CSI capture and old-vs-new DSP bench
  * web: Write point attributes directly and drop per-frame allocations
  * dsp: Split per-hop pipeline into hop.c and cut worker CPU ~16%
  * phasegaze: Span-sync LO tuner, parallel DSP, and camera AR UI
  * server: Set mongoose log level to MG_LL_ERROR

